<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>go-authn – Harden</title><link>https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/tags/harden/</link><description>Recent content in Harden on go-authn</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/tags/harden/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>harden — two security primitives, shared</title><link>https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/libraries/harden/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/libraries/harden/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What did every go-authn repository copy?&lt;/strong&gt; Two small rules, now in one
module with no dependency but the standard library.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;go get github.com/go-authn/harden@v0.3.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
